; Release feature set. The historical VERIFY_* feature names are retained so
; the established diagnostic builds can still select individual modules.
; These flags compile gameplay code, not input tapes or test fixtures.
; HD_DEVELOPMENT opts out for isolated experiments and baseline builds.
